// Row 1 of the front display: the timer, the task title, a message body.
//
// The same heights as Sprint 5, condensed: capitals and lowercase are 3px
// wide except where a letter cannot be read at 3px (M, N, W, m, w).
//
// Drawing rules, enforced by tools/glyphs-to-ts.js:
//   - every block is the full height of the font: ascent rows, then descent
//     rows, so the baseline sits under row 5 in every drawing;
//   - no blank column at either edge -- the gap between letters is
//     letterSpacing and nothing else;
//   - no two glyphs drawn identically (l, 1, I, | and 0, O, o stay distinct);
//   - all of printable ASCII, plus the ellipsis.
//
// Digits are all 3px wide so a running timer does not shift as it counts.

name: Sprint Small
ascent: 5
descent: 2
letterSpacing: 1

